+    ///   strings; the PIC sym arm rebuilds the base in reserved %rcx; the
+    ///   alloca arm only accepts Direct slots (pure `%rbp/%rsp` strings).
+    /// * Store value staging: immediates go direct (`mov $imm,mem`, no
